  "description": "Adds the icon-based Origins Upgrades screen with Time Warp, Island Event, the native Another One of Those Barrels event with a dynamic three-space 150/256-record guard, and removable 500,000-tech-point Tech Point and Food Point Doublers. Time Warp advances every villager by exactly 3 displayed years at every active game speed; the required wall-clock shift is 3 hours at half speed, 6 hours at normal speed, and 10 hours at double speed. Doubler ownership is confined to the current save, and Island Event awards are not multiplied. Adds Villager Upgrades for Grant Youth, Grant Full Mastery, Grant Running, and Set Age to 18. Grant Running only uses an available normal Likes slot on the displayed villager and removes Running from that villager's Dislikes; it refuses without charging when all normal Like slots are occupied and does not alter any movement behavior or speed value.",
